---
<GuideLayout title="Best MW4 DMZ Traits" lang="zh-CN">
  <div slot="definition">
    <p>本表收录 MW4 DMZ <strong>特质 / 天赋（Traits）</strong>：所属树、效果摘要与核实状态。</p>
    <p>标题含 “Best” <strong>仅对齐搜索意图</strong>；官方<strong>不提供</strong>强度排名——本页禁止写成官方「最佳」排序。</p>
    <p>结构与 Major（Main）Traits 名称/效果以官方 FOB Part 2「The Three Trait Trees / Example Traits」为准。</p>
    <p><strong>Cost / points：</strong>官方此文未给出完整点数梯子，整列留空（见下表注）。</p>
  </div>
  <div slot="how-to">
    <ol>
      <li>按 <strong>Tree</strong> 筛选；<code>confirmed</code> 效果句贴近官方措辞。</li>
      <li><strong>Cost / points</strong> 列本批整列空着（无官方全表）；不得把媒体梯子写成 <code>confirmed</code>。</li>
      <li>Minor Traits 随机可见；未在官方 Example 中点名的 Minor 不进本批 <code>confirmed</code> 表（Adaptive Restock / Field Crafting / Die Hard 见下：官方列在对应 Main 标题下，按正文一并 <code>confirmed</code>）。</li>
      <li>「怎么搭配 / meta」若无一手依据，整段不写或标 <code>reported</code>。</li>
      <li>回 <a href="/dmz-mw4/">/dmz-mw4</a>。</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
  <div slot="body">
    <h3>树与结构（机制）</h3>
    <div class="table-scroll">
      <table>
        <caption>MW4 DMZ Traits — 9 行 confirmed 树与结构机制</caption>
        <thead><tr>{["Topic", "Summary", "Status", "Last verified", "Sources"].map(column => <th scope="col">{column}</th>)}</tr></thead>
        <tbody>{mechanismRows.map(row => <tr>{row.map(cell => <td>{cell}</td>)}</tr>)}</tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <h3>Major (Main) Traits 表</h3>
    <p><strong>筛选项：</strong> Trait · Tree · Status</p>
    <FilterableTable
      columns={["Trait", "Tree", "Cost / points", "Effect summary", "Status", "Last verified", "Sources"]}
      caption="MW4 DMZ Major (Main) Traits — 21 行 confirmed 名称与效果"
      id="mw4-dmz-best-traits"
      rows={rows}
      isTemplate={false}
      note={"Cost / points：无官方全表，整列留空（禁止填媒体梯子）。"}
    />
    <p>官方正文写 “six Main (visible) Traits … and one initially-awarded random Minor Trait”，但三树例表均在 <strong>Main … Traits</strong> 标题下各列 7 项。本批对例表中出现的全部名称与效果句标 <code>confirmed</code>；若后续官方澄清第 7 项为 Minor 示例，可将 Adaptive Restock / Field Crafting / Die Hard 调整为「例示 Minor」，保留效果句 <code>confirmed</code> 并调整 Tree 分类注释。</p>
    <p><strong>禁止：</strong>「最佳」排名、meta build 定论、未官方点名的 Minor 全表、媒体 Cost 梯子。</p>
  </div>
  <div slot="sources">
    <div class="table-scroll">
      <table>
        <caption>Sources and update dates</caption>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">#</th><th scope="col">Source</th><th scope="col">Date</th><th scope="col">Notes</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr id="source-1"><td>1</td><td><a href="https://www.callofduty.com/blog/2026/10/call-of-duty-modern-warfare-4-dmz-how-to-play-forward-operating-base-guide">DMZ Deep Dive, Part 2: FOB Full Intel Guide</a></td><td>October 09, 2026；核验 2026-10-24</td><td>三树、66/22/18、Main Trait 名与效果、Prestige 规则与 Cash</td></tr>
          <tr id="source-2"><td>2</td><td><a href="https://www.callofduty.com/blog/2026/10/call-of-duty-modern-warfare-4-ready-for-launch-progression-prestige">Ready for Launch: Progression and Prestige</a></td><td>October 19, 2026；核验 2026-10-24</td><td>DMZ 1–70 口径对照；不替代 Part 2 的 Trait 例表</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p>Sources: <a href="#source-1">[1]</a><a href="#source-2">[2]</a></p>
  </div>
</GuideLayout>
